part records
  tally 2
  note "Bank Olcha's exports of the joint account. tally 2 names no import for this dialect (a |-separated file with yyyymmdd dates, decimal commas, space thousands, header lines and a balance-after column; observation O:D-1), so only the rows a question reads are written here, by hand, each citing its file and line: the rent, the building fees and the boiler (D-HR1), Kuba's transfers, the notary's deposit, the redemptions' credits and two tax payments. Every other row is left out, so no version says covers; the balances the questions read are the exports' balance-after figures, written as stated readings that anchor the account."
  note "A row is known on its own day, as the story dates what the exports show (story.md: 'known 2025-12-30 · records/olcha-2025-12.csv'); a version is known on its first row's day."

input bank: observed
  note "rows of Bank Olcha's exports of LN73 4400 2011 0000 8817 2264 0001"

version olcha_start
  cite story
  known 2024-01-01
  opening[konto] = 29147.27 at 2024-01-01 start "story.md, what we had on 1 January 2024"

version olcha_2024_05
  cite olcha
  known 2024-05-17
  anchor konto
  stated[konto] = 46761.80 at 2024-05-17 end "olcha-2024-05.csv line 21, the balance after the day's last row"

